{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Shimon and Levi, brothers.</b> Because they were always of one counsel, he addressed them together, which he did not do for the rest of the brothers." "<b>Weapons of violence are their kinship.</b> Their alliance with one another is a weapon of violence — how many acts of violence emerge from their counsel." "<b>מכרתיהם.</b> In the sense of 'a man from his acquaintance' (מכרו)."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:08.298116342Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}